        <activityName xml:lang="en">Ethanol, 99.7% in H2O, from Swedish wood, at service station</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Ethanol, 99.7% in H2O, from Swedish wood, at service station
This inventory is modelled using data of the regional distribution of petrol in Switzerland.;
UUID: 5df85e1d-7c50-342a-aba7-6ab1b8e9cfc2
Supply of ethanol at service stations in Switzerland including ethanol production and transports from Sweden to Switzerland.
Location: The inventory is modelled for Switzerland including import of ethanol from Sweden.
Technology: Production of ethanol from Scandinavian softwood chips.
Time period: Nicht spezifiziert
Production volume: World ethanol production was around 276 Mio hl in 2003.
Sampling: Literature data. 
Extrapolations: none
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_5df85e1d-7c50-342a-aba7-6ab1b8e9cfc2.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
